1
00:02:31,068 --> 00:02:41,068
All pirates searching for the treasure One Piece must brave the second half of the Grand Line.

2
00:02:41,068 --> 00:02:45,068
These wild and dangerous seas are known as the New World.

3
00:02:45,068 --> 00:02:52,068
Gold Roger and his crew were the only men to ever chart these waters and learn all the secrets they held.

4
00:02:52,068 --> 00:02:58,068
For the rest of the pirates of the world, this has proven to be the end of the road, a graveyard of dreams.

5
00:02:58,068 --> 00:03:09,068
Now, Monkey D. Luffy, a boy whose body became rubber after eating the gum gum fruit, set sail into the New World with his faithful crew.

6
00:03:09,068 --> 00:03:13,068
I'm gonna be the king of the pirates!

7
00:03:16,068 --> 00:03:25,068
During their journey to the New World, Luffy and his crew arrive on Fishman Island, which is located 10,000 meters below sea level.

8
00:03:25,068 --> 00:03:32,068
The Fishman Pirates, led by Hordy Jones and assisted by Vander Decken, plot to overthrow King Neptune.

9
00:03:33,068 --> 00:03:37,068
It's not long before the Straw Hats get pulled into the conflict.

10
00:03:37,068 --> 00:03:44,068
That is my army.

11
00:03:44,068 --> 00:03:47,068
30,000 slaves we've captured this month.

12
00:03:47,068 --> 00:03:49,068
All human, too.

13
00:03:51,068 --> 00:03:56,068
And then there's 70,000 Fishmen, trained in combat.

14
00:03:56,068 --> 00:03:59,068
They're all from the Fishman district.

15
00:03:59,068 --> 00:04:00,068
Or can't you tell?

16
00:04:00,068 --> 00:04:07,068
Now behold, 100,000 United Outlaws!

17
00:04:07,068 --> 00:04:14,068
You see, this is power!

18
00:04:14,068 --> 00:04:18,068
Because my followers have faith in change!

19
00:04:18,068 --> 00:04:24,068
It's taken 10 years, but it's time that we finished what I began so long ago!

20
00:04:24,068 --> 00:04:26,068
